WEBVTT

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.160
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.160
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:24.210
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:24.210
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:40.970
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:40.970
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:45.980
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:45.980
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:51.190
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:51.190
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:56.360
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:56.360
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:01.790
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:01.790
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:12.590
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:12.590
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:17.680
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:17.680
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:22.560
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:22.560
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:28.350
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:28.350
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:34.190
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:34.190
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:43.740
<i>Led by the eight crests,
the children's new adventure began.</i>

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:50.670
<i>What awaits the children who search for
a power to counter the Great Catastrophe?</i>

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:58.760
<i>To heal Patamon and Tailmon who are
exhausted from Millenniumon's battle,</i>

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:02.220
<i>Joe's group heads toward
the hot springs, but...</i>

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.520
The hot springs are gone!

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:14.150
Why...

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:16.280
Did we come to the wrong place?

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:20.490
Where did all those hot springs go?

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:21.550
Achoo!

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:24.830
Hikari! This isn't good,
go inside Komondomon.

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.000
But...

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:31.560
Why?

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:34.420
It really was here.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:38.010
Wait just one moment!

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:44.740
Let the hot springs bloom!
Let the banquet begin!

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:48.390
Who is the fellow
behind the hot spring's steam?

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:54.520
That would be
the continent's most stylish Digimon...

00:02:56.320 --> 00:03:01.070
Kabukimon!

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:00.110
KABUKIMON

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:05.580
Um?

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:10.250
Excuse me, do you know
the hot springs that used to be here?

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:13.040
Too bad, so sad!

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:17.550
They have all dried up!

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.550
What?!

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:21.050
No way...

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:23.140
Rest assured!

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:28.060
If you need a hot spring, there is one
within the mansion where my lord resides!

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:30.270
Lord?

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:33.230
Anyhow, there's a hot spring, right?!

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:35.560
Aren't we lucky, Patamon?

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:39.070
We would love to bathe in that hot spring!

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.490
Then!

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:46.160
The party of six, right this way!

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:51.330
THE GEKO HOT SPRINGS' REVOLT

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:55.080
Gekomon, open the gates!

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:09.560
Now, feast your eyes
on this magnificent and most stunning...

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:13.850
Shangri-La!

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.440
Amazing...

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:18.610
Mansion!

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:19.900
I'm surprised!

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.900
What a sight.

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.660
Down on your knees!

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:30.660
Presenting the master of Geko Hot Springs,

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:34.160
Lord Tonosamagekomon!

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:42.850
It's really a hot spring!

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:44.050
Yes!

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.550
Hold your horses!

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:48.300
What is it now?

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.270
Get back, swine!

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:54.810
This is no spring
that you commoners can bathe in!

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:58.360
Huh? Weren't you going to let us
in the hot spring?

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:03.820
I did say there is one,
but I never said you may bathe in it!

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.990
TONOSAMAGEKOMON

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:12.290
Um, what do you mean?!

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:17.620
The only hot spring in this world
is the one that my lord bathes in!

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:21.130
<i>We got rid of all the others!</i>

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:25.130
<i>What?! You mean those
dried up springs were your doing?!</i>

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.140
How cruel!

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:31.390
You can't get away with--

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:36.890
Say whatever you like,
but all that my lord decides is absolute!

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:41.900
I don't understand.
Then why guide us all the way here?

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.980
That is to...

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.240
How is the tasting, my lord?

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:53.540
Gomamon!

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.710
How cozy!

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.840
Of course, my lord!
What a good eye you have!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:08.300
This coziness and softness!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:11.680
Just my type! Very good indeed!

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:14.140
What do you call yourself?

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:16.270
I'm Gomamon!

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:17.560
Goma?

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:22.310
Ogoma! What a nice name!

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:27.440
Ogoma, you are my bride starting today!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.320
Bride...

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.330
What's that?

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.080
Bride?

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:42.460
Wait a second, what do you mean?!
Ogoma? A bride?

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:45.960
Hey, what is your lord thinking?!

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:52.090
The most cozy bride
fit for the most cozy hot spring!

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:59.850
My lord who has grasped the two
is now the ultimate cozy shogun!

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:03.320
It's useless! Both of them are nuts!

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:08.400
They must have only partially absorbed
information from the human world.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:12.950
"The ultimate cozy shogun," my butt!
Get your hands off me!

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.530
Gomamon!

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.660
Kobushi Tone!

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.510
You guys!

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:33.220
Now, let's get cozy in this bath, Ogoma.

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:34.970
No, stop!

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:38.900
-No, no, no!
-Now, my lord, please enjoy!

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:41.190
No!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:46.360
Oh, no, no, no! Somebody!

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.240
Joe-san!

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:49.820
Are you okay?

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:52.030
Heave ho!

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:57.710
Thank you. Is everyone okay?

00:07:57.710 --> 00:07:58.960
Yeah, but...

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:01.330
Gomamon's been captured!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.710
Yeah, we'll go rescue...

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:09.840
This familiar-looking hair! Can it be?!

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:11.380
Leave it to me!

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:14.550
Neko Punch!

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:22.600
I knew it! Nanimon! Blossomon!

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.400
Tailmon!

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.360
This is nothing.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:31.530
Um... long time no see!
A-Are you all okay?

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:34.370
Are they your friends?

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:37.870
When I came here before,
we kind of became acquainted...

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.370
<i>or sort of picked on.</i>

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:49.130
They must've lost their hot-spring haven
and have nowhere to go.

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.880
Poor things.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:56.680
<i>Whatever the past may be,
we shared the same bath at one point.</i>

00:08:57.090 --> 00:09:03.060
<i>Can you turn a blind eye
to these Digimon suffering, Joe Kido?!</i>

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:05.980
Anyhow, let's all warm up.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:07.480
Should we make a fire?

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:10.400
Joe-san, do you have
something to light a fire...

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:12.320
Huh?

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:30.590
Give Gomamon...
and everyone's hot springs back!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:32.760
GEKOMON

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:34.590
Huh?!

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:43.600
Safety first!

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:46.100
Joe!

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.570
Thank you so much!

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:53.610
Agumon!

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:55.570
You're welcome!

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.110
Nice catch!

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.120
How sweet, how sweet.

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:14.590
Let go! Let go of me!

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.170
You still haven't given up?

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:26.180
Your friends are probably frozen solid
in the icy snow by now!

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:29.690
That won't ever happen!

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:35.990
I love it when you get angry.
It makes the bath even cozier!

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:40.240
Are you trembling? How innocent and cute!

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:42.040
<i>I'm worried about everyone...</i>

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:45.540
<i>I gotta do something
and find a chance to escape!</i>

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.750
I'm not exactly scared.

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:54.250
<i>I can't give up!</i>

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:55.970
I got the story.

00:10:55.970 --> 00:11:00.510
So we can't get near Tonosamagekomon's
mansion that easily then.

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:04.510
The Gekomon's defense was like a barrier.

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.730
Break through that barrier!

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:09.020
Giga Destroyer!

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.730
If you attack like that...

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:13.280
The whole mansion will be destroyed.

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:17.530
If we attack carelessly
and something happens to Gomamon inside...

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:21.030
If you can't get inside,

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:23.070
just lure them outside.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.780
That's it, Tailmon!

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:30.040
W-We just need to think of how
to lure them out though.

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.920
I have an idea!

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:42.510
Oh, no...

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:46.020
Let it happen! Let it happen!

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:48.680
Please stop...

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.570
It's a nice warm bath thanks to Ogoma!

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:55.110
The heat will get to my head!

00:11:57.190 --> 00:12:01.900
<i>How long do I have to put up with this?
There's no chance for me to escape!</i>

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:07.490
M-My lord!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.670
There's an emergency!

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.420
Up it goes!

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:19.000
Here's another one!

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:24.050
Come on, come on!
It's real cozy down here!

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:26.770
The local special, snow-viewing bath!

00:12:26.770 --> 00:12:29.010
Come on down!

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:30.860
Our hot spring is cozy!

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:32.520
Come on over!

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:37.650
Hip hip hooray! Hip hip hooray!

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:40.820
A new hot spring has emerged!

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:43.650
How dare they?!

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:48.660
I shall dry any hot spring
other than mine with my own hands!

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:50.660
Let us set out!

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.050
Huh? You're making a bath?

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:04.560
Our lord is a noble figure who exerts
the most power when soaking in a tub.

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:09.390
My lord must always be in a cozy bath!
Now, let us depart!

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:16.900
If I leave the bath for even a moment,
I feel so weak from the cold!

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:24.900
A cozy bath is the root of my power!

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:26.610
I see...

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.450
Forward!

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:31.370
DONDOKOMON

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.750
Here they come!

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:41.590
They're coming! Woohoo!

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.840
It's all according to your plan!

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:47.260
Yeah, there's no way
they could ignore a new hot spring!

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.600
Everyone, get ready!

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.520
Okay!

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:53.220
<i>Just hold on, Gomamon,</i>

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:55.140
<i>I swear I'll save you!</i>

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:58.480
It's hot spring steam!

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:01.780
<i>Can that be?!</i>

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:06.490
Say, my lord,
I really wanna try that hot spring...

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:08.490
right this second!

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:11.740
Ogoma!

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.500
My lord, please wait!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:27.760
Our target hopped
into the bath in no time!

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:31.100
It's a bit lukewarm.

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:33.510
Ogoma, how is the bath?

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:38.860
Who are you?!

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:41.650
Where did Ogoma go?!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:48.280
Where did you all come from?!

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:51.820
Joe!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:53.410
Gomamon!

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:55.290
Ogoma!

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:01.170
Gomamon, welcome back!

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:02.920
I'm back!

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.260
I knew it was your plan right away, Joe!

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:09.170
Nanimon and Blossomon too, thank you!

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:11.060
The plan was a success!

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:12.730
Thank goodness, Gomamon!

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:14.020
Now, next!

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:15.180
Yeah!

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:17.350
Hurry!

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:19.180
Oh! Who's there?!

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:21.530
We won't let you go any farther!

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:24.190
We'll be the ones to take you down!

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:25.520
How dare you...

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:28.570
All of you, get them!

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:30.860
Mega Flame!

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:35.450
I shall strike you down!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:41.710
Ogoma!

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.170
I'm not Ogoma!

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:46.470
I'm Gomamon, Joe's partner!

00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:48.050
Tonosamagekomon!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:51.220
We're gonna have you return
everyone's hot springs!

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:55.640
Gomamon Evolution!

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:02.600
Ikkakumon!

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:08.160
That Digimon draws power from hot springs!

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:11.110
Oh, that explains the bath!

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:15.830
But this Digimon's weak to the cold
and can't move outside the bath!

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:18.490
Okay, drag Tonosamagekomon out of--

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:25.830
My... My...

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.380
My ideal bride!

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:37.560
Here, take my passionate smooch
for sure this time!

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:39.140
Eek!

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:41.890
Renjishi!

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:53.400
Come, come! Come this way!

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:55.910
Kobushi Tone!

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:03.910
As long as I am the cozy shogun,
I am unbeatable!

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:06.260
-Whoa!
-Ikkakumon's lips are in danger!

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:07.920
Ikkakumon!

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:10.340
Let it happen!

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:13.260
The bath being
the power source is troublesome!

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:15.260
We gotta do something about that!

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:18.980
Oh, I know! We don't need to force
the enemy out of the bath.

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:21.810
Ikkakumon, attack there!

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:24.310
Roger! Harpoon Vulcan!

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.070
I-It's getting cold!

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.740
Add hot water! Hot water!

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:39.250
Sorry, but no can do, my lord!

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:40.200
What?!

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:41.700
That's because...

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:47.170
<i>this is a fake hot spring
created by us to lure you here!</i>

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:55.840
It's just a puddle.
Once it gets cold, you're done for!

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:00.720
Now, everyone! Drop in more snow!

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:03.220
Go, go, go!

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:04.680
Harpoon Vulcan!

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:12.230
My power is fading...

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:14.400
Ikkakumon!

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:21.490
Ikkakumon Super Evolution!

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.000
Zudomon!

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.510
That is not a cozy appearance!

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:42.760
Bury yourself in snow, my lord!

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:44.010
Here!

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:53.860
This is no water puddle!
More like an icy lake!

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:55.650
Greymon!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:03.370
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:13.090
Metalgreymon!

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:15.550
We don't need to hold back now!

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:18.300
Giga Destroyer!

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:26.470
What?!

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:38.530
What?!?

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:40.660
Kabukimon?!

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:41.990
My lord!

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:43.660
It's cold!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:45.160
Ahem!

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:48.250
W-Wait!

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:51.550
How about we give you
half the castle's hot spring?

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:53.420
That's a deal!

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.500
Hot springs are for everybody!

00:19:56.800 --> 00:20:02.260
<i>It's a valuable place where everybody can
bathe to warm their hearts and bodies!</i>

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:07.230
Enough floating around in your
cozy shogun delusion! Wake up!

00:20:07.230 --> 00:20:09.430
Hammer Spark!

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:19.780
Serves you right!

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.530
Yay!

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:23.320
Well done!

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:27.530
It's all thanks to everybody!

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:29.620
Thank you!

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:37.550
Patamon, how is it?

00:20:37.550 --> 00:20:39.130
It feels nice!

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:41.260
Ah, I'm in heaven.

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:43.680
Maybe I'll join too.

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:47.550
Hey, you guys.

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:50.350
There's still room in the bath.

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:51.680
What?

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:55.610
Are you saying we can join the bath too?

00:20:55.610 --> 00:20:58.650
Remember?
I said hot springs are for everybody.

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:02.700
Y-Yes, sir! I am truly grateful, my lord!

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.910
L-Lord? Me?

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:07.120
Hey there, lord of the lord!

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:10.370
Umm, should I be happy about that?

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:13.830
Well, anyway,
let's all enjoy the hot springs!

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:17.380
Nice indeed!

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:24.050
It feels great when we all bathe together!

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:26.510
Hot springs are awesome!

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:33.100
<i>ima mazari atteku border</i>

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:33.100
<i>The border has now begun to blend</i>

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:35.940
<i>koko kara wa jinrui mitou desu!</i>

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:35.940
<i>"It's uncharted territory from here!"</i>

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:38.480
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:38.480
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:42.570
<i>nozomu kagiri no subete ga aru kara</i>

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:42.570
<i>All that you desire awaits you</i>

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:55.830
<i>owari nanka nai ze sou sa</i>

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:55.830
<i>The end doesn't exist, that's right</i>

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:58.500
<i>koko wa ima bokura no shuppatsuten</i>

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:58.500
<i>We're at our starting point right now</i>

00:21:58.670 --> 00:22:01.130
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:21:58.670 --> 00:22:01.130
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:04.720
<i>dare mo shiranai asu wa aru kara</i>

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:04.720
<i>There's a tomorrow that no one knows about</i>

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:06.720
<i>waratte iyou</i>

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:06.720
<i>So keep on smiling</i>

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:10.680
<i>imasara tachidomarenu bokura no
nichijou jou</i>

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:10.680
<i>We're past the point of stopping
In our daily lives</i>

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:12.180
<i>michi joutou!</i>

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:12.180
<i>Bring on the unknown!</i>

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:14.520
<i>ano hi kimi to kabe ni kaita</i>

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:14.520
<i>That day, I drew on the wall with you</i>

00:22:14.680 --> 00:22:17.140
<i>mikansei wo fukanzen wo</i>

00:22:14.680 --> 00:22:17.140
<i>The incomplete, the imperfect</i>

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:19.860
<i>imasara doko e mo ikenai ze tte</i>

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:19.860
<i>"You can't go anywhere at this point"</i>

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:22.570
<i>aa sou kai nee! aa sou kai nee!</i>

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:22.570
<i>Oh, is that so?! Oh, is that so?!</i>

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:28.660
<i>nara otona ni nanka natcha ikenai nee</i>

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:28.660
<i>Then we don't want to become a grown-up</i>

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:32.830
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.410 --> 00:22:35.830
<i>Tonosamagekomon.</i>

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:39.840
<i>The topknot-like antenna
and the two horns are unique traits.</i>

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:38.250
LEVEL: ULTIMATE

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:40.750
TYPE: AMPHIBIAN

00:22:39.840 --> 00:22:43.340
<i>The lord's singing voice
resonates lordship, I think!</i>

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:43.250
SPECIAL MOVE: KOBUSHI TONE

00:22:43.590 --> 00:22:45.260
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:49.800
<i>They say the Kobushi Tone's
low frequency waves could heal your body.</i>

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:53.520
<i>I have stiff shoulders from using
the computer too much lately.</i>

00:22:53.520 --> 00:22:55.100
<i>Can it heal that too?</i>

00:22:57.560 --> 00:22:59.980
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.440 --> 00:23:04.900
<i>Can Taichi and Greymon move
Rebellimon's heart</i>

00:23:04.900 --> 00:23:07.830
<i>and bring peace to the lawless lands?</i>

00:23:07.830 --> 00:23:12.200
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Vagrant War Demon, Rebellimon"</i>

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:14.910
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
